BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:national-doughnut-day-20270604@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270604
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270605
SUMMARY:National Doughnut Day
DESCRIPTION:National Doughnut Day falls on the first Friday in June\, and i
 t is one of the few food holidays with a documented founder\, a documented
  year\, and a reason for existing that has nothing to do with selling doug
 hnuts. The Salvation Army created it in Chicago in 1938 as a Great Depress
 ion fundraiser\, in tribute to the volunteers who had fried doughnuts for 
 American soldiers in France two decades earlier. The free-doughnut promoti
 ons came much later\, and from somewhere else.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.
 com/holiday/national-doughnut-day/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-doughnut-day/
CATEGORIES:Food
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
